# ===============================================================================
# Supabase / Postgres, Neo4j, Cube.js -- CLI-managed local & generated state
# ===============================================================================
# Supabase CLI scratch state (regenerated by `npm run supabase:start`; the
# exact directory has moved across CLI major versions -- both are kept):
.supabase/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
supabase/snippets/
.cube/
# Q14 (hardening plan): generated, non-deterministic artifacts previously
# committed to git despite being fully regenerated (random UUIDs/values on
# every run) by scripts/generate_synthetic_data.py and
# scripts/export_rdf_ontology.py -- every regeneration produced a ~20,000-line
# diff of no reviewable content. Removed from tracking (`git rm --cached`,
# files kept on disk); the documented pipeline already generates
# supabase/seed.sql *before* `supabase db reset` loads it (see CLAUDE.md's
# canonical pipeline order), so untracking it doesn't change the documented
# workflow at all.
supabase/seed.sql
ontology/instance_knowledge_graph.ttl
*.db
*.sqlite

# Dagster's own run history/logs/event storage (DAGSTER_HOME) -- local
# operational state, not source; see docs/APPLICATION_RUNBOOK.md's Dagster section.
orchestration/.dagster_home/

# Docker container volumes & data directories (bind-mounted, not source)
catalog/mysql-data/
catalog/mysql-data.bak-*/
catalog/opensearch-data/
# Q14 (container capability hardening, read_only): one-time extraction of
# the opensearch image's own default /usr/share/opensearch/config,
# bind-mounted read-write so OpenSearch can create its keystore file
# under read_only:true without a bare tmpfs shadowing the real config
# files it also needs. Generated by a `docker run ... cp` one-liner (see
# docker-compose.yml's openmetadata_search comment), not authored source.
catalog/opensearch-config/
neo4j/data/
neo4j/import/
neo4j/logs/
neo4j/plugins/

# ===============================================================================
# Editors, IDEs & local agent-tool state
# ===============================================================================
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Claude Code / agentic-tool local state. Personal overrides
# (settings.local.json) and skill symlinks are both machine-specific --
# e.g. .claude/skills/*, .agents/skills/* here resolve into this machine's
# own pyenv site-packages path and would be dead links on any other checkout.
# Deliberately narrow (not `.claude/`/`.agents/` wholesale) so genuinely
# shared, team-facing config placed there later isn't swept up by accident.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills/
.agents/skills/
.mcp.json

# Other local AI-assistant generated artifacts & logs
.system_generated/
brain/
*.log
*.tmp

